    "title": "Remington Oaks home tops Ocoee home sales from Feb. 2 to 8 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Michael Eng ,\n17 hours ago A Remington Oaks home topped all Ocoee residential real-estate transactions from Feb. 2 to 8. The home at 2139 Cunard Court, Ocoee, sold Feb. 6, for $390,000. Built in 2000, it has three bedrooms, two baths and 1,718 square feet of living area. Days on market: 76. The sellers were represented by Caridad Pool, Charles Rutenberg Realty Orlando. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
